233:  <li><strong>Delivery proof after K13 removal:</strong> Christie saves one member in Membership Manager. Evidence, all three: the trigger's execution log timestamped after the removal, ingest's 200 for that memberId, and its stored <code>sourceReadTime</code> later than the removal (it advances even when nothing else changed). If it fails: <strong>stop the link</strong> (runbook) and re-plan — never restore broad grants.</li>
