   253	<h2>Firebase safety checklist</h2>
   254	<ul>
   255	  <li>Every new collection gets an explicit rule and rules tests in the same commit as the code that writes it, deployed before the function (E-2, E-6).</li>
   256	  <li>Writers to my-clay-hub's member data: <code>ingestMemberUpdate</code> (single and reconcile) and <code>recomputeStatuses</code> (status and profile pause only) — both as <code>ingest@</code>, each change one transaction, never deletes.</li>
   257	  <li>Nothing writes to <code>tinker-hq-apps</code>: <code>clayhub-link@</code> holds only get/list; the codebase uses no write API (tested).</li>
   258	  <li>No forbidden field at any nesting level, and no full phone, crosses projects (contract + fixtures); no personal data in logs.</li>
   259	  <li>Emulator tests only; neither guard can reach the other project; the CLI credential file is never read.</li>
   260	  <li>Bulk changes bounded (Q8) and atomic: a reconcile and a recompute are each one transaction (≤ 250 members), so a stopped or failed run writes nothing.</li>
   261	</ul>
   262	
   263	<h2>Completeness check — if it's interrupted</h2>
   264	<ul>
   265	  <li>E-pre…E-4: docs and code on branches; nothing live until merged and deployed.</li>
   266	  <li>E-5 halfway: Console state is visible; re-read and continue. Nothing uses the accounts until E-6.</li>
   267	  <li>E-6 deployed, E-7 not: ingest is live with no caller — harmless.</li>
   268	  <li>E-7 released, E-8 not: <code>reconcileLink</code> is paused; triggers send each member whose doc is edited (once Q9's grant is in; before that they're refused and retried for 24 h); nothing reads the projection (no sign-in until Phase F).</li>
   269	  <li>K13 removed but delivery unproven: E-8 step 2 is the gate; if it fails, stop the link and re-plan — never restore broad grants.</li>
   270	</ul>
