/Users/christiehubley/tinker-ai-configs/thoughts/plans/clayhub-members-foundation.html:766:  <li><strong>Sep 28: ✅ Phase D complete</strong> (D-1, D-2, D-3, D-5; the Phase D plan's Decisions log is the record). The <code>my-clay-hub</code> project is live with deny-all Firestore + Storage rules, first deployed through its own guard at <code>2ad11ad</code> (receipts <code>deployed/my-clay-hub/firestore-rules/20260929T033845Z-2ad11ad</code>, <code>deployed/my-clay-hub/storage/20260929T034000Z-2ad11ad</code>; Console verified). <code>shared/denver-time.js</code> + <code>shared/derive-status.js</code> merged at <code>6a0233b</code> (Tinker-Art-Studio/my-clay-hub#1), reviewed by Codex + Claude. New decisions #56–59 (C6, C7, C8, and a pause with no end date → review). <strong>Next:</strong> Phase D2 (functions-aware deploy guard, its own plan), then D-4 (vault export), which gates Phase E's real member data.</li>
/Users/christiehubley/tinker-ai-configs/thoughts/plans/clayhub-members-foundation.html:767:  <li><strong>Sep 29: Phase D2 planned and approved</strong> as its own plan <code>firebase-functions-deploy-guard.html</code> (plan_a_Hq4YGUE5Hq; four review rounds, Codex + Claude; its Decisions log is the record). Christie approved amendments <strong>M1–M7</strong>, written into this plan in D2-2: M1 each project its own functions guard (<code>tinker-hq-apps</code>' at Phase E); M2 revision read-back via the CLI's config + hash plus Christie's Console reading; M3 invoker read-back via Christie's attested Console reading; M4 backstop tested through the CLI's hook runner; M5 the single-codebase gap covered by the "Skipping" check; M6 D-4 first extends the guard with scheduled functions; M7 <code>functions-build@</code> deleted (the CLI can't use it), <code>actAs</code> from Owner. The IAM inventory rows for the build account and <code>actAs</code>, the D2 decision row, Phase D2's list and D-4 are amended inline. D2-0 (Node 22) and D2-1 (both build candidates neutralized, <code>gcf-artifacts</code>, <code>canary@</code>) done Sep 29. <strong>Next:</strong> D2-2 (repo work), D2-3 (the guard), D2-4 (wording), D2-5 (first guarded release of the canary).</li>
