/Users/christiehubley/tinker-ai-configs/thoughts/plans/my-clay-hub-d4-vault-export.html:337:  <li><strong>V-4 bootstrap halfway (agent not yet granted):</strong> each scheduled or forced run fails and emails, which is correct; grant and continue.</li>
